'''''Frosty Blade's Trial''''' is a [[Companion Mission]] in the chapter [[Vita Infinita (Companion Mission Chapter)|Vita Infinita]].

==Steps==
# Compete swordsmanship with Jingliu as you vanquish abominations
# Keep going, it's a race against the clock
# Read the words left behind by Jingliu

